<title>PHILIPPINES: Alsons 2.0 bln peso capital hike gets nod.</title>
<headline>Alsons 2.0 bln peso capital hike gets nod.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Securities &amp; Exchange Commission (SEC) has approved the increase in authorized capital stock of Alsons Cement Corp to 2.0 billion pesos from 800 million pesos, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>Alsons said it will advise the Philippine Stock Exchange of the record date for the 50 percent stock dividend declared last May 4 upon approval of the SEC.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
